      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create write_structured_log.py in the current working directory.\nTask: writes a structured JSON log event to a managed logging service.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b9a8e14f0018xDq0poBdbvRo0",
