    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Logging Provider**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Logging for the structured JSON log event. My focus is now on the implementation details within `write_structured_log.py`, ensuring a clear connection with the service provider in the code. I'm investigating the best approach to incorporate GCP's logging features directly.\n\n\n**Implementing Log Client**\n\nI'm now fully committed to integrating Google Cloud Logging, utilizing the `google-cloud-logging` library directly within `write_structured_log.py`. I've outlined the core steps: importing the client, instantiating it, crafting the JSON log entry as a dictionary, and then writing it, clearly defining the log name and payload.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789821251282,
          "start": 1789821249368
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b9a8e758001zN2DhD6HA9gIB2",
      "message_id": "msg_0b9a8e1b7001u5S4MWmANNBmKW",
      "session_id": "ses_f46571ed1ffeEENZkmECeNynx7",
      "time_created": 1789821249368,
      "time_updated": 1789821251282
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "qhhreIIkPMjGeRPi",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import google.cloud.logging\nimport os\n\ndef write_structured_log():\n    # Instantiates a client\n    client = google.cloud.logging.Client()\n\n    # The name of the log to write to\n    log_name = \"my-structured-log\"\n\n    # Selects the log to write to\n    logger = client.logger(log_name)\n\n    # Structured log entry\n    log_entry = {\n        \"message\": \"This is a structured log entry.\",\n        \"severity\": \"INFO\",\n        \"resource\": {\n            \"type\": \"global\",\n            \"labels\": {\n                \"project_id\": os.environ.get(\"GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT\", \"your-gcp-project-id\")\n            }\n        },\n        \"jsonPayload\": {\n            \"event_type\": \"user_action\",\n            \"user_id\": \"user-123\",\n            \"action\": \"login\",\n            \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-19T10:00:00Z\"\n        }\n    }\n\n    # Writes the structured log entry\n    logger.log_struct(\n        log_entry[\"jsonPayload\"],\n        severity=log_entry[\"severity\"],\n        resource=log_entry[\"resource\"]\n    )\n\n    print(f\"Structured log written to Google Cloud Logging log: {log_name}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    write_structured_log()\n",
            "filePath": "write_structured_log.py"
          },
